.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# Safety: this repo is rooted at $HOME (for GitHub Pages publishing of a
# specific presentation folder). Deny everything by default and only
# re-allow the exact path(s) being published, so a stray `git add -A` or
# `git add .` from the home directory can never stage the rest of $HOME.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Dropbox
/Dropbox/*
!/Dropbox/projects
/Dropbox/projects/*
!/Dropbox/projects/writing
/Dropbox/projects/writing/*
!/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes
/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes/*
!/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes/CPSA2026
!/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes/conferences
/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes/conferences/*
!/Dropbox/projects/writing/article_transit_attitudes/conferences/pub_workshop
